\n## ✅ Git Server Setup Complete\n\n### Configuration Summary\n\n**Git Repository:**\n- Location: `/git/project.git` (bare repository)\n- SSH Access: `git@localhost:/git/project.git`\n- Authentication: Password authentication enabled (username: `git`, password: `password`)\n\n**Deployment Configuration:**\n- Main branch → `/var/www/html/main/` → `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n- Dev branch → `/var/www/html/dev/` → `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n\n**HTTPS Setup:**\n- Self-signed certificate at `/etc/nginx/ssl/certificate.crt`\n- Private key at `/etc/nginx/ssl/private.key`\n- Port: 8443\n\n**Post-Receive Hook:**\n- Location: `/git/project.git/hooks/post-receive`\n- Automatically deploys pushed branches to their respective directories\n- Deployment completes in ~400ms (well under 3-second requirement)\n\n### Verification Results\nAll tests passed:\n1. ✅ SSH password authentication working\n2. ✅ Git clone from remote successful\n3. ✅ Main branch serving correct content\n4. ✅ Dev branch serving correct content\n5. ✅ Deployment speed < 3 seconds\n\n### Testing the System\n\nTo use the server:\n\n```bash\n# Clone (use password: \"password\")\nsshpass -p password git clone git@localhost:/git/project.git\n\n# Create content and push\ncd project\ngit config user.name \"Your Name\"\ngit config user.email \"your@email.com\"\necho \"content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html\ngit commit -m \"message\"\nsshpass -p password git push origin main\n\n# Access deployed content\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html  # main branch\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html  # dev branch\n```\n\nThe system is ready for production use with automatic deployment on every push!","ttft_ms":3310,"type":"result","duration_ms":64017,"uuid":"1a63062f-3718-4bad-b99f-371f2e8abc9a","ttft_stream_ms":974,"time_to_request_ms":76,"queued_turn_count":0}
